                          "Citation": "GREEN P, GUY R, HADGRAFT J. In vitro and in vivo enhancement of skin permeation with oleic and lauric acids. International Journal of Pharmaceutics. 1988 Dec;48(1-3):103–11. doi: 10.1016/0378-5173(88)90252-9.",
